 171:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** ***************************************************************************************************
 172:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *                        ASSIGN A NAME TO A SEMAPHORE, MUTEX, MAILBOX or QUEUE
 173:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *
 174:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** * Description: This function assigns a name to a semaphore, mutex, mailbox or queue.
 175:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *
 176:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** * Arguments  : pevent    is a pointer to the event group.  'pevent' can point either to a semaphore
 177:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *                        a mutex, a mailbox or a queue.  Where this function is concerned, it doesn
 178:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *                        matter the actual type.
 179:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *
 180:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *              pname     is a pointer to an ASCII string that will be used as the name of the semap
 181:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *                        mutex, mailbox or queue.
 182:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *
 183:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *              perr      is a pointer to an error code that can contain one of the following values
 184:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *
 185:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *                        OS_ERR_NONE                if the requested task is resumed
 186:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *                        OS_ERR_EVENT_TYPE          if 'pevent' is not pointing to the proper event
 187:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *                                                   control block type.
 188:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *                        OS_ERR_PNAME_NULL          You passed a NULL pointer for 'pname'
 189:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *                        OS_ERR_PEVENT_NULL         if you passed a NULL pointer for 'pevent'
 190:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *                        OS_ERR_NAME_SET_ISR        if you called this function from an ISR
 191:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *
 192:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** * Returns    : None
 193:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** ***************************************************************************************************
 194:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** */
 195:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** 
