 685:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *
 686:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** * Notes      : 1) You MUST invoke OSIntEnter() and OSIntExit() in pair.  In other words, for every 
 687:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *                 to OSIntEnter() at the beginning of the ISR you MUST have a call to OSIntExit() a
 688:./ucos/Core/os_core.c **** *                 end of the ISR.
